OBSERVABILITY

Observability means understanding what your AI system is doing internally while it runs.

Without observability:

Agent failed ❌
Why?
Unknown.

With observability:

User Query
 ↓
Agent
 ↓
LLM call
 ↓
Tool call
 ↓
Database
 ↓
Error

You can inspect:

Prompts
Responses
Tool calls
Latency
Token usage
Errors
Retrieval results
Agent state
Why it matters

Production agents can have complex execution paths.

You need to know:

"Why did my agent give this answer?"
